Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:20:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sign-out relocation, minimal Billing screen, dark theme
 picker
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Three independent changes, deliberately excluding any change to
OverviewTab.tsx (that was a separate "declutter Overview" item from
the original plan, unrelated to sign-out and not part of this):

- Shell.tsx / SettingsTab.tsx: removed the always-visible "Out" /
  "Sign out" buttons from the sidebar and mobile top bar. Sign-out
  now lives as a deliberate action at the bottom of Settings.

- BillingSheet.tsx: cut it down to what actually needs a decision.
  Removed the intro paragraph and the second paragraph repeating the
  same instructions. Removed the Network and Plan <select> dropdowns
  entirely — both duplicated a choice already made by tapping a card
  above (plan cards, and now the two MoMo network cards, which are
  clickable/selectable instead of being static info panels). One
  short instruction line replaces two paragraphs. Submit button and
  success message shortened. Status pill colors now use theme
  variables instead of hardcoded light-mode hex.

- globals.css / inventory.css / SettingsTab.tsx: added a Theme picker
  row (studio/paper/slate/night) and adaptive --glass/--glass-border/
  --overlay/--shadow-glass variables so product pins and sheet
  overlays render correctly in dark themes instead of staying
  hardcoded to light-mode colors.

Verified: npm run build compiles cleanly, no lint/type errors.
